TITLE Calcite kinetics; report SI(Aragonite) at step 47
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH   5
    pe   4
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 0.5
    Mn   1

RATES
Calcite_simple
-start
10 k = PARM(1)
20 SA = PARM(2)
30 rate = k*SA
40 moles = rate * TIME
50 SAVE moles
-end

KINETICS 1
    Calcite_simple
        -formula CaCO3 1
        -m0 1.0
        -parms 0.001 10.0
        -steps 10 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file calcite_kin.sel
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -si Aragonite
END
